{"title": "Germany launches new electric car subsidy aimed at low-income households", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/20/germany-launches-new-electric-car-subsidy-aimed-at-low-income-households/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/20/germany-launches-new-electric-car-subsidy-aimed-at-low-income-households/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Germany launches new electric car subsidy aimed at low-income households\"><img alt=\"EV sales\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/20220427001652035168-original-380x285.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Germany launches new subsidy program for electric vehicles, offering up to €6,000 to lower-income households buying or leasing new EVs.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/20/germany-launches-new-electric-car-subsidy-aimed-at-low-income-households/\">Germany launches new electric car subsidy aimed at low-income households</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-19T21:06:15+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-23T07:26:09.646405+00:00"}
